{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/mf16cx","slide":1,"text":"Pitch cue: AnnSetu closes the visibility gap after a token is issued. It combines capacity-safe booking, assisted access and live queue tracking with an auditable procurement-to-payment journey.\n\nDemo cue: first show assistant booking from the centre console, then open the public tracker and search using the generated phone number or token. Continue through queue, procurement stages and the cash-only settlement rule for assistant bookings.\n\nEvidence: docs/pitch_deck/FEATURE_VALIDATION_CURRENT_CODEBASE.md; apps/web/src/screens/PublicBookingTracking.tsx; apps/web/src/screens/CenterDashboard.tsx; apps/api/src/modules/booking/booking.controller.ts; apps/api/src/modules/queue/queue.service.ts; apps/api/src/modules/payments/payment-policy.ts.\n\nQualification: AgriStack, Aadhaar, PFMS/DBT, SMS, USSD, IVR and state-portal connections are adapter-ready simulations or fallbacks in the current demo, not live government integrations."}